Subject: [PATCH 3372/3799] soh: rename D_808547A4 -> sBombchuSparkVelocity

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the velocity of the sparks the bombchu trail spawns
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Partner/z_en_partner.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Partner/z_en_partner.c | 5 +++--
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_player_actor/z_player.c   | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Partner/z_en_partner.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Partner/z_en_partner.c
